# WRITTEN PROSODY / manual syllable / word attacks using existing events.
# ; advances to the next event. A newline alone means parallel music.
# Tiny gates compress speech by resampling; use longer gates for intelligibility.
# Each l[] is synthesized separately here, with an exact written onset and gate.
!b80
l[this]:a220v4'n8 ;
l[is]:a247v3'n16 ;
l[the]:a262v3'n16 ;
l[first]:a330v4'n4 ;
l[sy]:a294v4'n8 ;
l[llable]:a220v3'n4r3
